## The brief

The screenshot above shows the public website supported by the admin platform.

The training centre needed a consistent way for authorised staff to create and update content across its website.

## What I built

I translated business requirements into a dashboard with role-based access and workflows for creating, reading, updating and deleting records. REST endpoints supported the admin interface across multiple operational modules.

## How I validated it

I traced the workflows back to the business requirements and ran more than 15 end-to-end user acceptance tests. My project records show that the new workflow cut content publishing time by half.
